   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "PengPong",
   "y": -560,
   "fontSize": 120
  },
  {
   "x": 0,
   "bgColor": "#0b1a3a",
   "bgOpacity": 0.0,
   "bgPadding": 0,
   "outline": 10,
   "color": "#19c6b7",
   "fadeIn": 0.0,
   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "$95 OF PAID TOOLS.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 70
  },
  {
   "text": "Ninety five dollars. That\nis every paid tool in this\nSteam demo, added up.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.904,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And one file in the build\nwas never supposed to\nship.",
   "start": 5.154,
   "duration": 3.128,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's what it is.\nPengPong is a\nsurvivors-like where a\npenguin with a hockey\nstick whacks whatever\ncomes at it, guns and\npufferfish included, drawn\nlike a nineteen thirties\ncartoon.",
   "start": 15.532,
   "duration": 10.155,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Korean studio, full game\nout in August, and the\nreviews all say the same\nword: Cuphead.",
   "start": 25.937,
   "duration": 5.792,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. It's Unity\non Mono, so every package\nsits there under its own\nname.",
   "start": 31.979,
   "duration": 5.61,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Paid tools: two. Sixty\nfive dollars and thirty.\nNo Spine. The Cuphead\nanimation is Unity's free\n2D package.",
   "start": 37.839,
   "duration": 8.483,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Assembly-CSharp.dll is\nfive kilobytes. The code\nmoved into eight modules\nwith the studio's name on\nthem, so they can carry\nthem to the next game.",
   "start": 46.572,
   "duration": 8.797,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And MCP for Unity is in\nthe release build. The\nbridge that lets an AI\nmodel drive the editor.\nHow they used it, only\nthey know.",
   "start": 55.619,
   "duration": 7.83,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
